# A circuit (gRace 3) with game.cars at 12 (docs/port/MORECARS.md 3.3, 10.3): the circuit stays the N64's 6 cars,
# the player and 5 drones, whatever the setting. The check: 6 cars, at places 0-5, each moved, while the race's
# latched count is 12.
# until: 0x400000:600
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 3, track 0
# args: --set game.cars=12 --log-cars
# check: tools/port/cars_check.py circuit12.log 6 --count 12
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen
15 DOWN 0.1    # the mode screen: three modes down
15.2 DOWN 0.1
15.4 DOWN 0.1
17 A           # the circuit
20 A           # the circuit screen (0x4000)
23 A           # the track select
26 A           # the car select
